sex</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Options the seller lists:</strong> Yellow, Green, Black, Purple, Blue, Red, Rally Assist Kit</p>\n<p><em>Source: AliExpress listing 1005005651266845, seller QzeUpwardSpirit Store, captured 2026-09-23. Shipping at capture: Free shipping over 100,00kr Delivery: Oct 03 - 10</em></p>","category","Gym accessories","images",[31,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,87,88,89,90,91],"shippingCostCents","shippingDaysMin","shippingDaysMax","shipsFrom","Mainland China","weightGrams","rating",4.7,"reviewCount",2845,"totalStock","lastSyncedAt",["D",1790121600000],"importedProductId","cmudu11ly0026usu4jji5fm36","supplier",{"_69":70,"_71":72,"_73":74,"_75":-5},"name","AliExpress","kind","MANUAL","description","Listings captured from AliExpress product pages. Prices and stock are a snapshot, not a live feed, and orders are placed on AliExpress by hand.","avgHandlingDays","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S34fefb8c03994dfa91f38e12f2823dabU.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S141c0e3a61ad45979ee4dfac10ce90684.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S2a5aee0bae63473f941d8064fab52140E.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S97dcc3f8c2f74ab6bb15063818c76d26z.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S34f59532f5304e22840bfa4e5cc69880e.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sa12d5c9573e54588acd4a31a5ba1b3beB.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S9d610b422dd64747a890c83a5fa17568g.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Se51dfc1f1ff745b8ad325e6f296f8b55f.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sd3a975ad1e764c06abaae7392b241b9eN.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S66c625b6cd374719ae0ce1fb4407c658B.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S7ba7f21ed89f49cc95839d1f18cf34a2x.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S998f42c6ff64457cbe2dd19d221d8e22q.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S8174884db5cb493c851d39599009514f0.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-me